Add scanned book sample-page PDFs with preview viewer

- 72 per-book sample PDFs under frontend-react/public/book-pages/, served
  same-origin by Cloudflare Pages (durable, not on Render's ephemeral disk).
- index.json manifest maps call_number (413/XX) to its file.
- BookDetailPage loads the manifest and shows a "Preview book pages" button
  (ar/en) for books that have a sample, opening the existing PdfReader on
  /book-pages/<file>; books without a sample show no button. Existing
  first/last-page lightbox and full-PDF reader unchanged.

The 2 non-numbered stray files are intentionally left out pending their
book mapping.

